      rix
 287  * -> can have several mapSecGood = 1 for given sec or for given good
 288  * need distrGoodSupplySAM in addition (?)
 289  ** AW 5/12: rewrote concerned parts, mapSecGood not needed anymore
 290  * mapSecGood(sec,good)$(USGN(sec,good))=1;
 291  *display mapSecGood;
 292  *execute_unload 'UserGSF.gdx' UGFN,UGSN,USGN, USFN, UFFN, UFGN, UFSN, mapS
      ecGood, distrGoodSupplySAM;
 293  execute_unload 'UserGSF.gdx' UGFN,UGSN,USGN, USFN, UFFN, UFGN, UFSN, distr
      GoodSupplySAM;
