 610  Parameters
 611  XDZ(sec,reg)              initial domestic gross production (output) level
 612  XDDZ(reg,sec,good)        detailed sectoral outputs
 613  IOZ(reg,good,sec)         initial intermediate demand for goods
 614  LZ(sec,reg)               labour inputs
 615  KZ(sec,reg)               capital inputs
